# Address of the AFRI-EDGE Routing API.
#
# Unset (or empty) means the dashboard runs on canned fixtures and says so on
# screen. Set it and every read goes to the real service — there is no separate
# "live mode" switch to forget, because the address IS the switch.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and set the value. .env.local is gitignored, so
# nobody's machine-specific address ends up in a commit.
#
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
